    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Vaultbreaker</h2><p><em>Locks are promises made by people who never met you.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You reroll the lowest die on checks made to locate hidden doors, panels, caches, and secret compartments.</p><p>Additionally, when you attempt to open a lock or disable a trap, you may treat a 2d10x10 roll of 9 or lower as a 10. Once you use this principle, you can’t use it again until you finish a short or Sanctuary.</p>",
